  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together red pepper paste and mayonnaise, if using.",
    "Brush the red bell peppers with olive oil and season with salt, black pepper, and garlic powder.",
    "Grill the red bell peppers for 5-7 minutes per side, or until tender and slightly charred.",
    "Once the peppers are cooked, let them cool slightly.",
    "Split the peppers open and fill with the red pepper paste mixture.",
    "Top with chopped fresh dill, if using.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with chopped parsley."
